      "title": "GW-3: Comment out router supported assets field in overview model",
      "message": "GW-3: Comment out router supported assets field in overview model\n\n- src/api/models/router.py: `RoutersOverview.supported_assets` is commented out, so the overview model no longer parses `supportedAssets` from the response\n- tests/api/swap/simulate/auth_test.py: the missing-auth-headers case now expects HTTP 200 instead of 403 while keeping the API_KEY_REQUIRED error body check\n",
